  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2012</mn></msup></math> in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2008</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2007</mn></msup></math> is equal to _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "0",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2008</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2007</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2007</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2007</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2007</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2007</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2007</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2007</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>General term in the expansion is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2007</mn></mmultiscripts><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2007</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mo> </mo><mn>2007</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msup></math></p><p>For coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>12</mn></msup></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2012</mn></math></p><p>But, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac><mn>2012</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2012</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2011</mn></math></p><p>But, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>≠</mo><mfrac><mn>2011</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, there is no term containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2012</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>So coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2012</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
